      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792430495518,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LDG 指令的硬件特性：",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "font": "normal",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LDG 指令的硬件特性：",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15.4,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "qxyB6-cCElax5p0BzaQA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 840,
      "width": 704.8798828125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ai",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 610015756,
      "version": 49,
      "versionNonce": 1709293806,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792430143512,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• LDG 发出后，硬件开始从 GMEM 读数据，但寄存器暂时不可用（数据在途）",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "font": "normal",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• LDG 发出后，硬件开始从 GMEM 读数据，但寄存器暂时不可用（数据在途）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14.3,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4FAVdYvPdzdPlgSvxsqI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 860,
      "width": 618.3199462890625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1099746915,
      "version": 45,
      "versionNonce": 1645703982,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792430143512,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 线程不会阻塞，继续执行后面的指令——这是硬件 scoreboard 机制",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "font": "normal",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 线程不会阻塞，继续执行后面的指令——这是硬件 scoreboard 机制",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14.3,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "KJC_kha0RyJ_EB2k12Zv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 210.0199737548828,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e3a8a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ak",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1899096417,
      "version": 46,
      "versionNonce": 1910844846,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792430484696,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "STS 指令的硬件特性：",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "font": "normal",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "STS 指令的硬件特性：",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15.4,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3obD65hYVyvvkc69wEkX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 393.679931640625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "al",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1054471094,
      "version": 45,
      "versionNonce": 821755822,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792430143512,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• STS 要消费寄存器里的数据（写 SMEM）",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "font": "normal",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• STS 要消费寄存器里的数据（写 SMEM）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14.3,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "UlRumj7DCnoVzJQLLdpp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "am",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 931891542,
      "version": 63,
      "versionNonce": 1562040814,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792430143512,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 如果 LDG 还没完成（寄存器数据不可用），硬件才会隐式等待——这是 scoreboard 的卡住点",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "font": "normal",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 如果 LDG 还没完成（寄存器数据不可用），硬件才会隐式等待——这是 scoreboard 的卡住点",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14.3,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
